<title>UK: West Brom H1 profits rise 133 pct.</title>
<headline>West Brom H1 profits rise 133 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		453		    vs 383</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 nil		    vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax (000s stg)	301,000		vs 129,000</p>
<p> Turnover		   3.40		   vs 2.84</p>
<p>NOTE - Soccer club West Bromwich Albion Plc, unveiling its first interim results since flotation on the Alternative Investment Market on January 3, said it did not intend to pay an interim dividend.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
